 pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Volume Cost</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Log\">Logged</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">Sanded</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">Planked</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Log\">?</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">?</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">?</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.93.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Limited</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\nOne such tree can cost up to 20,000🍬.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Corrupted Kelp</b> is a tree exlusive to the <a href=\"/wiki/2025_Halloween_Event\" title=\"2025 Halloween Event\">2025 Halloween Event</a>. It is found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Corrupt_Biome\" title=\"Corrupt Biome\">Corrupt Biome</a>, along the coastline of Ferwater. Corrupted Kelp has mouth-like appendages that will attack the player if they get too close to it, causing damage as well as pulling the player to the base of the tree. \n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Obtaining_.28during_Halloween_2025.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtaining_(during_Halloween_2025)\">Obtaining (during Halloween 2025)</span></h2>\n<p>Go to the <a href=\"/wiki/Corrupt_Biome\" title=\"Corrupt Biome\">Corrupt Biome</a> during the <a href=\"/wiki/2025_Halloween_Event\" title=\"2025 Halloween Event\">2025 Halloween Event</a> and swim along the coastline untill you find the hole in the where you can find the kelp.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tips_during_the_event:\">Tips during the event:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>It is recommended to have the <a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Scooba_Tank\" title=\"Refined Scooba Tank\">Refined Scooba Tank</a>, as it will allow you to more easily reach and harvest the kelp.</li>\n<li>A <a href=\"/wiki/Healing_Coil\" title=\"Healing Coil\">Healing Coil</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Fusion_Coil\" title=\"Fusion Coil\">Fusion Coil</a> is also recommended, which allows you to recover faster from the damage taken by the appendages.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\"Obtaining_.28outside_Halloween_event.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtaining_(outside_Halloween_event)\">Obtaining (outside Halloween event)</span></h2>\n<ol><li>Get any kind of kelp (<a href=\"/wiki/Kelp\" title=\"Kelp\">Regular Kelp</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Eel_Kelp\" title=\"Eel Kelp\">Eel Kelp</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Arctic_Kelp\" title=\"Arctic Kelp\">Arctic Kelp</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Luminescentkelp\" title=\"Luminescentkelp\">Luminescentkelp</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Plek\" title=\"Plek\">Plek</a>)</li>\n<li>Go to the <a href=\"/wiki/Uncertainty_Cave\" title=\"Uncertainty Cave\">Uncertainty Cave</a> and let your kelp be hit by the spores of a <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Mushrooms\" title=\"Mysterious Mushrooms\">Mysterious Mushrooms</a>.</li>\n<li>Boom! Your kelp will now become corrupted!</li></ol>\n<h3><span id=\"Disclaimer.21_.E2.9A.A0.EF.B8.8F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Disclaimer!_⚠️\">Disclaimer! ⚠️</span></h3>\n<p>If the tree gets hit <b>only once</b> it will turn into Corrupted Kelp, but if its hit again, it ill turn into regular <a href=\"/wiki/Corrupted\" title=\"Corrupted\">Corrupted</a> wood. This process is irreversible.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903000901\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.027 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 82/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 50/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019481/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   24.886      1 Template:Wood\n100.00%   24.886      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:4593-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903000901 and revision id 20926. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"2025 Halloween Event","exists":true},{"title":"Arctic Kelp","exists":true},{"title":"Corrupt Biome","exists":true},{"title":"Corrupted","exists":true},{"title":"Eel Kelp","exists":true},{"title":"Fusion Coil","exist